  "synopsis": "The story revolves around Qin Yu and his three brothers after ascending to the God Realm. As Qin Yu gradually learns the rules of the God Realm, he aspires to become the strongest craftsman god in order to marry Jiang Li, a member of one of the eight great families of the God Realm, whose status is vastly different from his own. Starting with eliminating bandits, he rises to become a high-level god, gaining the favor of the Holy Emperor and becoming a rising star… step by step, he finally reaches a position where he can openly propose to Jiang Li. \n\nHowever, faced with numerous suitors, the Jiang family, unable to choose, decides to hold a marriage contest for Jiang Li. Whoever can present three gifts that surpass the other competitors will win Jiang Li. Qin Yu endures hardships to forge an unprecedented first-class Primordial Spiritual Treasure as his final betrothal gift. He believes he has everything under control, but at the last moment, the Jiang family disregards fairness and declares Zhou Xian the winner. Qin Yu erupts in anger…\n\n(Source: Tencent, translated)",
